      "refersTo": "navigation",
      "description": "Desktop jade navigation with an ivory current page and the actual LayoutDashboard SVG.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-sidebar\"><nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"Điều hướng quản trị\"><button class=\"ds-nav-item ds-active\" aria-current=\"page\"><svg width=\"19\" height=\"19\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"7\" height=\"9\" x=\"3\" y=\"3\" rx=\"1\"/><rect width=\"7\" height=\"5\" x=\"14\" y=\"3\" rx=\"1\"/><rect width=\"7\" height=\"9\" x=\"14\" y=\"12\" rx=\"1\"/><rect width=\"7\" height=\"5\" x=\"3\" y=\"16\" rx=\"1\"/></svg><span>Phòng điều khiển</span></button><button class=\"ds-nav-item\">Lời cầu nguyện</button></nav></div>",
      "css": ".ds-sidebar{background:#19382c;padding:34px 20px 24px;} .ds-nav{display:grid;gap:8px;} .ds-nav-item{font-family:\"Be Vietnam Pro\",sans-serif;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;width:100%;padding:13px 14px;background:none;border:none;border-radius:9px;color:#c5d0c1;text-align:left;font-size:12px;min-height:46px;transition:background .15s;cursor:pointer;} .ds-nav-item svg{flex-shrink:0;} .ds-nav-item:hover{background:#244837;color:#fff;} .ds-nav-item.ds-active{background:#edf0e1;color:#224632;font-weight:600;} .ds-nav-item:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #a88649;outline-offset:4px;} @media(max-width:760px){.ds-nav{display:flex;gap:5px;overflow:auto;} .ds-nav-item{width:auto;flex:1;justify-content:center;white-space:nowrap;padding:11px 9px;gap:6px;font-size:10px;border-radius:7px 7px 0 0;min-height:41px;} .ds-nav-item.ds-active{background:#f5f3ec;} .ds-nav-item svg{width:16px;height:16px;}} @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-nav-item{transition:none;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Local tag",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "tag",
      "description": "Static context tag, including the final corrected text color.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-tag\">Cục bộ</span>",
      "css": ".ds-tag{font-family:\"Be Vietnam Pro\",sans-serif;display:inline-flex;padding:4px 7px;font-size:9px;color:#59684d;background:#edefe4;border-radius:4px;font-weight:400;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Operator panel",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "panel",
      "description": "Paper panel and actual heading/description styling; border provides separation without a shadow.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-panel\"><h2>Tương tác thử</h2><p>Gửi một tương tác để xem ngôi chùa chuyển động.</p></section>",
      "css": ".ds-panel{font-family:\"Be Vietnam Pro\",sans-serif;background:var(--paper,#fffcf6);border:1px solid #e2e4d8;border-radius:12px;padding:23px;} .ds-panel h2{font-family:\"Lora\",serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-.015em;color:#25372f;margin:0;} .ds-panel p{font-size:11px;color:#607054;line-height:1.8;margin:10px 0 18px;max-width:72ch;} @media(min-width:1600px){.ds-panel{padding:27px;}} @media(max-width:1200px){.ds-panel{padding:18px;}} @media(max-width:1000px){.ds-panel{padding:15px;}} @media(max-width:760px){.ds-panel{padding:22px;} .ds-panel h2{font-size:19px;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Shared temple progress",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "temple-progress",
      "description": "Container-scaled temple progress at 120 / 250; semantic progressbar and actual source proportions.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-temple\"><div class=\"ds-progress\"><div class=\"ds-progress-row\"><span>Cùng thắp sáng chánh điện</span><strong>120 <small>/ 250</small></strong></div><div class=\"ds-track\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Công đức chung\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"250\" aria-valuenow=\"120\"><span style=\"width:48%\"></span></div></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-temple{font-family:\"Be Vietnam Pro\",sans-serif;container-type:inline-size;color:#fff1d0;} .ds-progress{background:#231d13c9;border:1px solid #97754880;padding:3cqw 3.5cqw;border-radius:7px;} .ds-progress-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;align-items:center;font-size:2.3cqw;} .ds-progress strong{font-size:3.4cqw;color:#f4d593;font-weight:500;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;} .ds-progress small{font-size:2.4cqw;color:#bba47c;font-weight:400;} .ds-track{height:3px;background:#6a513464;margin-top:2.5cqw;overflow:hidden;border-radius:2px;} .ds-track>span{display:block;height:100%;background:#d4af63;transition:width .5s;} @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-track>span{transition:none;}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Chùa An Nhiên",
    "overview": "The approved [temple concept](docs/reference/temple-concept.png) remains the visual authority: an ornate golden Vietnamese altar, warm lanterns, dark carved teak, red prayer carpets and a kneeling congregation. Painted layered 2.5D artwork gives the temple its richness; Vietnamese labels and simple effects are rendered in code with smooth raster filtering.\n\nThe operator interface provides quiet ivory paper and deep jade navigation around the portrait preview. Restrained bronze details and Lora headings connect it to the temple while familiar Be Vietnam Pro controls keep operation legible and calm. This document records the implemented system, including the final small-text contrast corrections.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Golden painted temple with an altar focal point and layered congregation.",
      "Quiet ivory and jade operator surfaces with restrained ornament.",
      "Vietnamese typography, clear focus states and truthful connection labels."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Reference Rule",
        "body": "Preserve the approved golden temple artwork and its warm lighting when adding visual assets.",
        "section": "colors"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** preserve the approved painted altar, warm lanterns, red carpets and congregation.",
      "**Do** use Lora for temple/section titles and Be Vietnam Pro for Vietnamese controls.",
      "**Do** keep connection state truthful and distinguish simulated interactions in visible copy.",
      "**Do** retain visible keyboard focus, final contrast corrections and portrait proportions.",
      "**Do** inspect generated art at native scale and inside the engine before accepting it."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** substitute pixel art or enable pixel-art filtering.",
      "**Don't** bake labels, counters or controls into generated artwork.",
      "**Don't** present concept statistics or mock events as real account data.",
      "**Don't** turn the quiet operator panels into ornate temple artwork.",
      "**Don't** exceed the established 40 visible visitors, 180 effect sprites or 32 MB decoded core-art budget."
    ]
  }
}
